# The build stage copies pyproject, setup.py, README, LICENSE and rlmcp_studio/
# by name; this keeps everything else out of the context so a local artefact
# cannot ride into the image and make a "fresh" install pass for the wrong
# reason. Browser libraries fetched into a checkout are excluded too, so the
# image always exercises the build-time download.
*
!pyproject.toml
!setup.py
!README.md
!LICENSE
!rlmcp_studio/
rlmcp_studio/**/__pycache__/
rlmcp_studio/web/vendor/
